{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"1664","title":"XIAOMI RELEASES ALL-ROUND PERFORMANCE CHAMPION MI 11I IN GLOBAL MARKETS","desc":"Packing a Qualcomm® Snapdragon™ 888 and large-capacity battery into an ultra-slim design, Mi 11i offers flagship performance for users who want to get the most out of their device.","view_cnt":"517","like_cnt":"0","add_time":"1618824382","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/454_operatorx_operatorx_opx/19/04/2021/9fc0900af35f59de2d6003dcef336f6b.png"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://blog.mi.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Screen-Shot-2021-03-29-at-2.18.29-PM-1024x543.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBeijing, CHINA, March 29 – Xiaomi today introduced its latest performance champion, Mi 11i, a perfect daily driver and a treat for power users. Mi 11i comes equipped with the latest Qualcomm\u003csup\u003e®\u003c/sup\u003e\u0026nbsp;Snapdragon™ 888 mobile platform, an E4 AMOLED display and boasts 120Hz refresh rate, Dolby Atmos\u003csup\u003e®\u003c/sup\u003e\u0026nbsp;and dual speakers, an ultra-large capacity 4,520mAh (typ) battery – all in an elegant and lightweight design.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStar performance with flagship Qualcomm\u003c/strong\u003e\u003csup\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e®\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;Snapdragon\u003c/strong\u003e\u003csup\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e™\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/sup\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;888\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11i is equipped with the latest Qualcomm\u003csup\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e®\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/sup\u003e\u0026nbsp;Snapdragon\u003csup\u003e™\u003c/sup\u003e\u0026nbsp;888 mobile platform. This flagship chipset boasts advanced 5nm process technology that allows higher performance while consuming less energy and providing a super fast and reliable user experience. The mobile platform is also the first to adopt the ARM Cortex-X1 ultra-large core, providing a significant jump in peak performance. LPDDR5 storage and UFS 3.1 flash memory are also on board, completing Mi 11i’s flagship performance package.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11i supports the latest generation Wi-Fi 6. The phone’s Wi-Fi capabilities have been boosted even further, increasing the bandwidth to 160MHz while 4096-QAM encoding provides for higher information density, drastically increasing peak speeds to a maximum of 2.89Gbps\u003csup\u003e1\u003c/sup\u003e. Mi 11i can maintain high-speed, low latency and stable Wi-Fi connection, even in complex network environments with multiple devices connected.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStar visuals and immersive clear audio with 120Hz refresh rate and Dolby Atmos\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://blog.mi.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Screen-Shot-2021-03-29-at-2.28.45-PM-1024x523.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eContrary to the Mi 11 and Mi 11 Ultra, Mi 11i features a flat screen display while its premium glass body, 7.8mm thickness and redesigned side-mounted fingerprint scanner offer a more comfortable grip and feel for the user. With a 6.67” tiny hole-punch display Mi 11i offers an uninterrupted edge-to-edge viewing experience. The brand-new Samsung E4 AMOLED display can reach a peak brightness of 1300nits while consuming little power. The display delivers a stunning array of vivid colors with DCI-P3 color gamut and HDR10+ support. Thanks to meticulous calibration, the device achieves color accuracy of JNCD≈0.36 and ΔE≈0.35 for stunning color representation. The resulting effect is an outstanding display with a A+ rating in tests carried out by the prestigious display testing organization, DisplayMate.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith a 120Hz refresh rate, Mi 11i delivers an ultra-smooth and satisfying viewing experience for everything from everyday swiping to playing high frame rate games and videos. A maximum 360Hz touch sampling rate ensures an extremely responsive touchscreen that enables excellent control in fast-paced games.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThanks to light sensors on the front and back of the body, Mi 11i supports 360° light sensing technology. The sensors serve to effectively improve the accuracy of automatic brightness, delivering 8192 levels of brightness for a smoother and much more precise transition. Mi 11i also features a dedicated in-built ambient light sensor to adjust the color temperature based on the lighting levels of the external environment.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://blog.mi.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Screen-Shot-2021-03-29-at-2.29.45-PM-1024x475.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith Dolby Atmos\u003csup\u003e®\u003c/sup\u003e\u0026nbsp;and dual speakers, Mi 11i creates a truly immersive audio experience. Dolby Atmos\u003csup\u003e®\u003c/sup\u003e\u0026nbsp;lends an incredible audio quality with unparalleled detail and depth both for headphone and speaker audio. This professionally tuned sound will take users on an epic lifelike journey as they enjoy their favorite movies, TV shows and mobile games.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStar photography with 108MP triple camera and Audio Zoom\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11i is equipped with pro-level photography capabilities powered by a 108MP HD triple rear camera array. This array is composed of a 108MP HD main camera, an 119° ultra-wide-angle camera, and a 50mm equivalent focal length telemacro camera.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://blog.mi.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Screen-Shot-2021-03-29-at-2.21.11-PM-1024x729.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe 108MP main camera offers outstanding low-light photography thanks to 9-in-1 2.1μm Super Pixel support. Additionally, Dual Native ISO technology enables it to capture an excellent level of detail in dark areas of an image – even when taken in bright lighting conditions – while avoiding overexposure of brightly lit areas. Accompanying the main camera is the 119° ultra-wide angle camera that has been perfectly adapted to take images of landscapes, buildings, and groups of people. Finally, the 5MP telemacro camera boasts a 50mm equivalent focal length, twice that of the standard macro lenses currently on the market, which enables higher magnification from the same distance and a clearer focus on details.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11i has been designed with a host of features to enhance filming quality. First, unlike the standard dual-microphone design of most smartphones, Mi 11i adopts a triple microphone setup, enabling Audio Zoom. Capture clear audio of far-away scenes while simply zooming in on a subject with the camera. The device can capture videos in 8K and maintains a high performance at night with the Ultra Night Video mode. A host of additional AI and video editing features allows users to quickly and easily enhance the picture quality and complete videos, all without having to purchase expensive editing software.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eElegant design without compromises on battery life and versatility\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://blog.mi.com/en/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Screen-Shot-2021-03-29-at-2.22.49-PM-1024x592.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAt just 7.8mm in width, Mi 11i feels super lightweight and comfortable in the hand, achieving a sleek and stylish design without compromising on battery life. Powered by a 4,520mAh (typ) large capacity battery, the smartphone cruises through a full day of use without needing to be recharged. When it does need a boost, its 33W fast charging technology allows it to power up from low battery to 100% in just 52 minutes\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11i rounds out its flagship experience with an X-linear motor for clean, powerful and highly responsive haptics, along with an IR blaster and NFC support for contactless payment\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11i comes in three colors: Celestial Silver, Frosty White, and Cosmic Black.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11i is offered in two storage variants: 8+128GB and 8+256GB, priced at EUR 649 and EUR 699 respectively\u003csup\u003e3\u003c/sup\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMi 11i will be available for pre-orders through all official Xiaomi channels soon.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMi 11i Quick Specs:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003csup\u003e1\u0026nbsp;\u003c/sup\u003e2.89 Gbps is the theoretical value of Mi 11i’s Wi-Fi 6 speed. Tested in Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e\u0026nbsp;Data from Xiaomi labs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003csup\u003e3\u0026nbsp;\u003c/sup\u003eAvailability may vary in different markets, subject to availability.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003csup\u003e4\u0026nbsp;\u003c/sup\u003e5G connectivity will vary based on region and local operator capabilities.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct images available here: Mi 11i\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (\u003ca href=\"http://1810.hk/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(157, 161, 173);\"\u003e1810.HK\u003c/a\u003e). Xiaomi is an internet company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an Internet of Things (IoT) platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith an equal emphasis on innovation and quality, Xiaomi continuously pursues high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi ranked 3rd globally in terms of smartphone shipments in the fourth quarter of 2020. The company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, with 324.8 million smart devices connected to its platform, excluding smartphones and laptops. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In August 2020, the company made the Fortune Global 500 list for the second time, ranking 422nd, up 46 places compared to 2019. It also ranked 7th among internet companies.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"14","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1618889539"},"common":null}